{
  "id": "609",
  "title": "How Far is the City Center",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2018-12-01",
  "synopsis": "Ben asks a passerby how far it is to the city center.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/903/8339cb7d9c7ba317478a1275f66fc93f635a95d0.mp3?1575020996",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 5: You’re my best friend",
    "chapter": 4,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "去市中心要多少分钟\n\n本：你好！请问去市中心要多少分钟？\n路人：走路去要40分钟。\n本：好远啊！\n路人：那你可以坐公共汽车去，5路车可以到。\n本：坐公共汽车去要多少分钟？\n路人：15分钟。\n本：好的，谢谢你！",
    "traditional": "去市中心要多少分鐘\n\n本：你好！請問去市中心要多少分鐘？\n路人：走路去要40分鐘。\n本：好遠啊！\n路人：那你可以坐公共汽車去，5路車可以到。\n本：坐公共汽車去要多少分鐘？\n路人：15分鐘。\n本：好的，謝謝你！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "How many minutes does it take to go to the city center?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：你好！请问去市中心要多少分钟？",
      "traditional": "本：你好！請問去市中心要多少分鐘？",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ hǎo qǐng wèn qù shì zhōng xīn yào duō shao fēn zhōng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Hello! May I ask how many minutes it takes to go to the city center?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "路人：走路去要40分钟。",
      "traditional": "路人：走路去要40分鐘。",
      "pinyin": "lù rén zǒu lù qù yào 2 fēn zhōng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Passerby: By foot it takes 40 minutes."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：好远啊！",
      "traditional": "本：好遠啊！",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo yuǎn a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: That’s really far!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "路人：那你可以坐公共汽车去，5路车可以到。",
      "traditional": "路人：那你可以坐公共汽車去，5路車可以到。",
      "pinyin": "lù rén nà nǐ kě yǐ zuò gōng gòng qì chē qù 1 lù chē kě yǐ dào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Passerby: Then you can take the public bus. Line 5 goes there."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：坐公共汽车去要多少分钟？",
      "traditional": "本：坐公共汽車去要多少分鐘？",
      "pinyin": "běn zuò gōng gòng qì chē qù yào duō shao fēn zhōng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: How many minutes does it take by bus?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "路人：15分钟。",
      "traditional": "路人：15分鐘。",
      "pinyin": "lù rén 2 fēn zhōng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Passerby: 15 minutes."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "本：好的，谢谢你！",
      "traditional": "本：好的，謝謝你！",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo de xiè xie nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Ok, thank you!"
    }
  ],
